<!--
    Production manifest - Tallimedia/LiigaWatch, public Connect IQ Store
    listing "Liiga Watch". The kavaleff/FILiigaWatch `beta` branch has its
    own app id and a smaller device list, same split as VolvoWatch and
    FIWeatherWatch - see CLAUDE.md's "Garmin watch apps" section.

    Device list, 2026-10-14: FIWeatherWatch's 70-device list plus the
    families RESEARCH.md §6 flagged as in-scope but not yet added -
    Instinct 2/2S/2X/E/Crossover/3, Enduro/Enduro3, vívoactive 4/4S,
    Forerunner 55. All widget-capable at minApiLevel 3.4.0; v1's pure-text
    UI (acronyms, digits, no graphics) has no reason to need more.

    The monochrome Instinct line (instinct2/2s/2x, instinct3solar45mm,
    instinctcrossover, instincte40mm/45mm) previously couldn't ship at all
    - Theme.LIVE/FAVORITE rendered invisible on their true 2-colour
    palette. Fixed via monkey.jungle's per-device excludeAnnotations
    (Theme.mc has the detail) rather than excluding them again.

    App id generated fresh with: uuidgen | tr -d - | tr 'A-Z' 'a-z'
-->
